{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.selfTime\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">PostprocessTraces</span>.<span class=\"name\">selfTime</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TracePostprocessor\">TracePostprocessor</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Appends the number of milliseconds spent inside each subtree but outside of its child nodes to\nthe subtree's head message. Timing information is only available with\n`set_option trace.profiler true`; nodes without it are not annotated.\n","docLink":"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.selfTime","kind":"def","line":127,"name":"Lean.PostprocessTraces.selfTime","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.lean#L127-L141"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.countNodes\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">PostprocessTraces</span>.<span class=\"name\">countNodes</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TracePostprocessor\">TracePostprocessor</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Appends the number of nodes inside each subtree to the subtree's head message. ","docLink":"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.countNodes","kind":"def","line":109,"name":"Lean.PostprocessTraces.countNodes","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.lean#L109-L120"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.exposeSubtrees\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">PostprocessTraces</span>.<span class=\"name\">exposeSubtrees</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">p</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TracePattern\">TracePattern</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TracePostprocessor\">TracePostprocessor</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Expands all transitive ancestors of the subtrees matching `p` in the editor, so that the trace\nopens already showing all matches. No nodes are removed, and all other nodes, including the\nmatches themselves, keep their expansion state. Matching subtrees are not searched for nested\nmatches.\n","docLink":"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.exposeSubtrees","kind":"def","line":91,"name":"Lean.PostprocessTraces.exposeSubtrees","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.lean#L91-L107"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.hoist\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">PostprocessTraces</span>.<span class=\"name\">hoist</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">p</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TracePattern\">TracePattern</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TracePostprocessor\">TracePostprocessor</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Hoists the subtrees matching `p` to the top level, so that every new trace root is a match;\nancestors and unrelated subtrees are discarded. Matches nested inside other matches are not\nsearched for.\n","docLink":"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.hoist","kind":"def","line":83,"name":"Lean.PostprocessTraces.hoist","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.lean#L83-L89"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.filterSubtrees\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">PostprocessTraces</span>.<span class=\"name\">filterSubtrees</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">p</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TracePattern\">TracePattern</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TracePostprocessor\">TracePostprocessor</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Keeps only the subtrees matching `p`, together with their ancestors for context; all other nodes\nare removed. Matching subtrees are kept in their entirety and not searched for nested matches\n(see `TraceTree.filterSubtrees`).\n","docLink":"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.filterSubtrees","kind":"def","line":75,"name":"Lean.PostprocessTraces.filterSubtrees","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.lean#L75-L81"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.minSelfTimeMs\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">PostprocessTraces</span>.<span class=\"name\">minSelfTimeMs</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">ms</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float.html#Float\">Float</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TracePattern\">TracePattern</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Matches the subtrees whose action took at least `ms` milliseconds outside of their child nodes.\nTiming information is only available with `set_option trace.profiler true`.\n","docLink":"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.minSelfTimeMs","kind":"def","line":64,"name":"Lean.PostprocessTraces.minSelfTimeMs","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.lean#L64-L69"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.minTimeMs\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">PostprocessTraces</span>.<span class=\"name\">minTimeMs</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">ms</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float.html#Float\">Float</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TracePattern\">TracePattern</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Matches the subtrees whose action took at least `ms` milliseconds.\nTiming information is only available with `set_option trace.profiler true`.\n","docLink":"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.minTimeMs","kind":"def","line":57,"name":"Lean.PostprocessTraces.minTimeMs","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.lean#L57-L62"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.unsuccessful\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">PostprocessTraces</span>.<span class=\"name\">unsuccessful</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TracePattern\">TracePattern</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Matches the trace nodes whose action did not succeed, i.e. failed (❌️) or threw an exception\n(💥️). Nodes without a recorded result (e.g. from `addTrace`) do not match.\n","docLink":"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.unsuccessful","kind":"def","line":50,"name":"Lean.PostprocessTraces.unsuccessful","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.lean#L50-L55"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.errored\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">PostprocessTraces</span>.<span class=\"name\">errored</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TracePattern\">TracePattern</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Matches the trace nodes whose action threw an exception (💥️, `TraceResult.error`). ","docLink":"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.errored","kind":"def","line":46,"name":"Lean.PostprocessTraces.errored","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.lean#L46-L48"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.failed\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">PostprocessTraces</span>.<span class=\"name\">failed</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TracePattern\">TracePattern</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Matches the trace nodes whose action failed (❌️, `TraceResult.failure`). ","docLink":"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.failed","kind":"def","line":42,"name":"Lean.PostprocessTraces.failed","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.lean#L42-L44"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.succeeded\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">PostprocessTraces</span>.<span class=\"name\">succeeded</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TracePattern\">TracePattern</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Matches the trace nodes whose action succeeded (✅️, `TraceResult.success`).\nNodes without a recorded result (e.g. from `addTrace`) do not match.\n","docLink":"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.succeeded","kind":"def","line":35,"name":"Lean.PostprocessTraces.succeeded","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.lean#L35-L40"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.containsString\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">PostprocessTraces</span>.<span class=\"name\">containsString</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">pat</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TracePattern\">TracePattern</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Matches the subtrees whose trace class or head message contains `pat` as a substring.\nFor large traces, this is an expensive pattern because all head messages need to be\npretty-printed; to select nodes by their exact trace class, prefer the much cheaper `ofClass`.\n","docLink":"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.containsString","kind":"def","line":25,"name":"Lean.PostprocessTraces.containsString","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.lean#L25-L33"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.ofClass\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">PostprocessTraces</span>.<span class=\"name\">ofClass</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">cls</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Basic.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.TracePattern\">TracePattern</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Matches the trace nodes with the exact trace class `cls`. ","docLink":"./Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.html#Lean.PostprocessTraces.ofClass","kind":"def","line":21,"name":"Lean.PostprocessTraces.ofClass","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/PostprocessTraces/Postprocessors.lean#L21-L23"}}],"imports":["Lean.CoreM","Lean.PostprocessTraces.Basic"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.PostprocessTraces.Postprocessors"}